 libspa-0.2-libcamera - libraries for the PipeWire multimedia server - libcamera plugin
 libspa-0.2-modules - libraries for the PipeWire multimedia server Simple Plugin API -
 pipewire   - audio and video processing engine multimedia server
 pipewire-alsa - PipeWire ALSA plugin, for ALSA applications to output via PipeWir
 pipewire-audio - recommended set of PipeWire packages for a standard audio desktop
 pipewire-audio-client-libraries - transitional package for pipewire-alsa and pipewire-jack
 pipewire-bin - PipeWire multimedia server - programs
 pipewire-doc - libraries for the PipeWire multimedia server - documentation
 pipewire-jack - PipeWire JACK plugin, for JACK applications to output via PipeWir
 pipewire-libcamera - transitional package for libspa-0.2-libcamera
 pipewire-pulse - PipeWire PulseAudio daemon
